* news_process v3.2.0 — Data prep (plan v14 §9.2)
*
* 加载 stage 46 .dta + xtset + winsor + apply labels.
* Main spec choices: locus={{MAIN_LOCUS_TRACK}} subst={{MAIN_SUBST_TRACK}} sent={{MAIN_SENT_TRACK}}

version 19
clear all
set maxvar 32767

* 1. 加载 core .dta (Stata IC ≤ 2048 兼容)
use "data/processed/46_panel_yearly_core.dta", clear
display "  Loaded: `=_N' bank-year obs × `=c(k)' variables"

* 2. 加载 variable + value labels
capture do "data/processed/46_panel_yearly_labels.do"

* 3. 主键编码 + xtset
capture confirm variable bank_id
if _rc {
    encode target_bank, gen(bank_id)
}
xtset bank_id year

* 4. Winsor 关键连续变量 (1% / 99%, Loughran & McDonald 2011 JF 惯例)
local main_dv      llm_vote_tone_{{MAIN_SENT_TRACK}}
local main_locus   tech_frac_{{MAIN_LOCUS_TRACK}}
local main_subst   symb_frac_{{MAIN_SUBST_TRACK}}

* 检查 winsor2 是否可用 (ssc install winsor2)
capture which winsor2
if !_rc {
    foreach var of varlist `main_dv' `main_locus' `main_subst' {
        capture confirm variable `var'
        if !_rc {
            winsor2 `var', cuts(1 99) replace
        }
    }
    display "  ✅ Winsorized 1%/99% on main DV + LOCUS + SUBST"

    * v3.5.1 A1+A3: winsorize 8 新列 (per plan v0.3 §2.5.3 修 M4' guard).
    * `capture confirm variable` guard 保证不引用 A1/A3 的 paper 跳过, 不抛错.
    * 同 winsor 阈值 1%/99% (Loughran-McDonald 2011 JF 惯例) + Hales 2011 CAR 量化披露
    * 饱和度 fallback (修 R7-M1 + R8-M4 num_intensity / clarity 同 winsorize).
    foreach v3_5_1_var in mean_clarity_score_full mean_clarity_score_ctx ///
                          mean_frac_definite_full mean_frac_definite_ctx ///
                          frac_amb_articles_full frac_amb_articles_ctx ///
                          mean_num_intensity_full mean_num_intensity_ctx {
        capture confirm variable `v3_5_1_var'
        if !_rc {
            winsor2 `v3_5_1_var', cuts(1 99) replace
        }
    }
    display "  ✅ v3.5.1: A1+A3 8 cols winsorized (graceful via capture confirm)"
}
else {
    display "  ⚠️ winsor2 not installed (ssc install winsor2); skip winsorization"
}

* 5. 派生交互项 (主回归用)
capture confirm variable digital_frontier
if !_rc {
    gen byte _has_df = !missing(digital_frontier)
    display "  digital_frontier 非缺失: `=_has_df'/`=_N' bank-year"
    drop _has_df
}

display "✅ Data prep done. Ready for tables."
